{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達於11月2日展示了RTX Spark的實機運行情況。目前已有97款熱門PC遊戲能夠以Arm原生版本或通過Prism良好運行，產品發售時的支持範圍將達到數百款，但部分競技遊戲仍受反作弊適配限制。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584982.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.112378+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:59:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_hash":"4758a4f23069ecb10835e7f449b096e57235041df27f191ee1f3ceea22639d5a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}